{{Quote|''A social hangout world in VRChat designed primarily for furry and other communities to meet, relax, and socialize.''}}

'''Furry Hideout''' is a user-created social [[Worlds|world]] in [[VRChat]] designed primarily as a hangout space for furries and other players. The world provides a place for users to meet, relax, socialize, and spend time together.

The world was created by the VRChat user '''Lt_Shadow''', also known as '''Shadow''', who is credited as the author and creator of Furry Hideout.

Furry Hideout was originally published in April 2021 and has received multiple updates since its creation.

==Features==

Furry Hideout contains several features intended for socializing and relaxing with other VRChat users.

Furry Hideout world lets you leap into the air and physically move your arms up and down like wings to glide, rise, and steer around the map

Furry Hideout Patreon Supporters get a special perk that allows them to use the in-game video player and fly with the trigger of their VR controller.

===Social hangout===

The primary purpose of Furry Hideout is to provide a casual environment where users can meet and socialize. Visitors can explore the world and interact with other players.

===Avatar support===

The world is designed to accommodate users with a variety of VRChat avatars, including furry avatars.

===Video player===

Furry Hideout includes a video player that can be used by visitors to watch supported video content together.
Tho is only accessible for patreon supporters.

==Community==

Furry Hideout has developed a community around the world, with users returning to the world to socialize and meet other members of the VRChat community.

The creator also maintains community and social channels where users can follow updates and information relating to Furry Hideout.

==Updates==

